+# Async Runtime Policy
+
+The project's current recorded decision is to use Tokio as its async runtime. Tokio was chosen because it is the de facto standard in the Rust ecosystem, and its larger ecosystem of compatible libraries and broader community support favor compatibility and long-term maintainability.
